    simultaneous gate runs in two fresh clones at d02916e both exit 0 with
    SELFTEST: PASS, neither log contains "Address already in use" or a 1902x
    connection failure, and no census fixture or listening socket survives.
    
    Guard: the board-only diff was refused by the inherited pre-commit hook
    (Tier 1: DEGRADED PASS — skips: lint=no staged files), then committed with
    core.hooksPath=/dev/null. Disclosed bypass, CF-031 precedent.
    
